msgstr "Порт 2"

#: port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:79 port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:85 port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:89 port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:257
